386	## Best Practices
387	
388	- Prefer cursor-based pagination for real-time feeds (no skipped/duplicate items on insert).
389	- Use offset-based pagination when total count or page jumping is required.
390	- Set `prefetchDistance` to 3-5 items so loading starts before the user reaches the end.
391	- Use `RemoteMediator` for offline-capable paginated lists backed by a local database.
392	- Always handle all three load states: `refresh`, `append`, and `prepend`.
393	- Cache `PagingData` in `viewModelScope` with `.cachedIn()` to survive configuration changes.
394	- Show shimmer placeholders during initial load; show a footer spinner for append loads.
395	- Implement pull-to-refresh by calling `articles.refresh()` on `LazyPagingItems`.
